  "original_requirement": "Original TODO26: audit the 56 WebForms-biased service files for non-.NET behavior. Specialized services must no-op clearly as not applicable or generalize; produce_claude_md, pre_commit_review gates and coding-style analysis must be language-neutral.",
  "demonstrated": [
    "32 authored direct public calls on Node return explicit not-applicable with no analysis, preserving source/project information/jobs despite applicable .NET/WebForms projects in the same registry.",
