    "Custom authored retrieval queries still retrieve their source; an unsupported legacy slice retains that source and explains applicability. Business-logic analysis rejects unsupported file/project languages before model calls or persistence.",
    "Candidate and installed private MCP runs pass against the same pinned build. Normal installed daemon identity and project_info verified; production registry/source selection/other metadata and configuration unchanged."
  ],
